      53.49,
      325.09,
      534.09,
      360.16
    ],
    "text": "FILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE PUTTALAM URBANCOUNCIL UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      373.09,
      482.9,
      384.16
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the office of member of Puttalam Urban Council has fallen vacant by reason of Resignation;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      397.09,
      539.99,
      456.16
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the leader of the Independent Group 01 , the Independent Group to which NizamdeenMohamed Fazil the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decideupon returned member if Independent Group 01 who belongs to such Independent Group and is not disqualified underSection 9 of the local authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period ofthirty (30) days ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      469.09,
      539.85,
      492.16
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the leader of the aforesaid Independent Group, has communicated his decision to nominateSelladurai Naguleshwaran to fill such vacancy ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      505.09,
      539.93,
      540.16
    ],
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE I, Nagalingam Regan, Returning Officer of the Puttalam Urban Council, acting in terms ofSection 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that Selladurai Naguleshwaranwas Selected as the member of the Puttalam Urban Council.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      436.05,
      553.09,
      533.51,
      588.16
    ],
